## 11. Acceptance Criteria

- Selected event details display correctly.
- Event title matches the selected event.
- Date, time, location, and description display.
- RSVP button opens RSVPPage.
- Selected EventId is passed correctly.
- Back navigation works.
- Guests can view public event details.
- Private event access is restricted.
